ning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0689":{"code":"F-0689","title":"Ensure that a nursing home area is free from accident hazards and provides adequate supervision to prevent accidents.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0698":{"code":"F-0698","title":"Provide safe, appropriate dialysis care/services for a resident who requires such services.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0726":{"code":"F-0726","title":"Ensure that nurses and nurse aides have the appropriate competencies to care for every resident in a way that maximizes each resident's well being.","category":"Nursing and Physician Services Deficiencies","concept":"staffing","concept_label":"Staffing & supervision"},"cms-f0838":{"code":"F-0838","title":"Conduct and document a facility-wide assessment to determine what resources are necessary to care for residents competently during both day-to-day operations (including nights and weekends) and emergencies.","category":"Administration Deficiencies","concept":"administration","concept_label":"Administration & records"},"cms-f0880":{"code":"F-0880","title":"Provide and implement an infection prevention and control program.","category":"Infection Control Deficiencies","concept":"infection_prevention","concept_label":"Infection prevention"},"cms-f0627":{"code":"F-0627","title":"Ensure the transfer/discharge meets the resident's needs/preferences and that the resident is prepared for a safe transfer/discharge.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-k0345":{"code":"K-0345","title":"Have approved installation, maintenance and testing program for fire alarm systems.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0353":{"code":"K-0353","title":"Inspect, test, and maintain automatic sprinkler systems.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0918":{"code":"K-0918","title":"Have generator or other power source capable of supplying service within 10 seconds.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0324":{"code":"K-0324","title":"Provide properly protected cooking facilities.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0541":{"code":"K-0541","title":"Install properly constructed and protected linen or trash chutes.","category":"Services Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0812":{"code":"F-0812","title":"Procure food from sources approved or considered satisfactory and store, prepare, distribute and serve food in accordance with professional standards.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0814":{"code":"F-0814","title":"Dispose of garbage and refuse properly.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0925":{"code":"F-0925","title":"Make sure there is a pest control program to prevent/deal with mice, insects, or other pests.","category":"Environmental Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0577":{"code":"F-0577","title":"Allow residents to easily view the nursing home's survey results and communicate with advocate agencies.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0804":{"code":"F-0804","title":"Ensure food and drink is palat