iciencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0919":{"code":"F-0919","title":"Make sure that a working call system is available in each resident's  bathroom and bathing area.","category":"Environmental Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0908":{"code":"F-0908","title":"Keep all essential equipment working safely.","category":"Environmental Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0626":{"code":"F-0626","title":"Permit a resident to return to the nursing home after hospitalization or therapeutic leave that exceeds bed-hold policy.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-k0100":{"code":"K-0100","title":"Meet other general requirements.","category":"Construction Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0580":{"code":"F-0580","title":"Immediately tell the resident, the resident's doctor, and a family member of situations (injury/decline/room, etc.)  that affect the resident.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0610":{"code":"F-0610","title":"Respond appropriately to all alleged violations.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0658":{"code":"F-0658","title":"Ensure services provided by the nursing facility meet professional standards of quality.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0692":{"code":"F-0692","title":"Provide enough food/fluids to maintain a resident's health.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_la